				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "What would be nice is to get an overview (visualization?) of the growth of a student in the scoring of rubrics. At Fontys ICT we use 3 or 4 evaluation moments in which the teacher scores the rubrics (between 5 and 8 typical) at the levels Undefined, Orienting, Beginning, Proficient and Advanced. \n\nWhen working on, say, evaluation 3, it would be nice to have a quick overview of the students' score on the previous evaluation. "
